It can be seen that even with the highly conservative set of inputs used in this calculation, there is a factor of safety between the ASET and the RSET of {% if not aset_triggered %}at least {% endif %}{{ margin_of_safety }} seconds. Given this, it is our view that it is a credible assumption that it would be possible to justify the extended travel distances within the warehouse during the fit-out stage.
